      "artist": "Herusutimbul",
      "description": "This mosque is a witness to the history of the greatness of the Deli Malay Sultanate.\nLocated on Jalan Sisingamangaraja, Medan, Masjid Raya Al Mashun stands firm and majestic. The architecture of this mosque is a blend of Middle Eastern, Spanish and Indian styles.\n\nConstruction of this mosque began in 1906 and was completed in 1909, carried out during the reign of Sultan Ma'mun Al Rashid and cost about 1 million guilders.",
